<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia retail trade data delayed to Sept 3.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia retail trade data delayed to Sept 3.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of Australian retail trade data for July has been delayed until Tuesday September 3, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said in a statement.</p>
<p>The release was originally due to be released this Friday.</p>
<p>The ABS said the revised data was due to processing delays.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
